{
  "id": "PD-TRUST-01",
  "note": "0.1.3 (small-fixes review): SessionStart keeps last-version in this plugin's own data folder, the name Claude Code derives from the plugin id <name>@<marketplace> (characters outside A-Z, a-z, 0-9, _ and - as -; the marketplace from CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT: .../plugins/cache/<marketplace>/<name>/<version> installed, else inline for a --plugin-dir run): CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA when its last part is exactly that name, else that folder beside another plugin's (the codex plugin exports its own into session shells; a <brand>-<other> folder is another plugin's too), whose folder is never read or written; one record, so a version change is logged once whichever value a session sees. A folder named like ours outside plugins/data, or none: no record (a relative one or one with a .. part: the HOME guard keeps those out of a case); never the log folder. A synced plugin (.../plugins/synced/<x>/<name>, also with the ~g<n> suffix Claude Code may add to that folder; any other suffix, ~x or ~g with no digits, is not that form) is <name>@synced: its own folder is <brand>-synced",
